{
  "snp3.5:0.1": "",
  "snp3.5:0.2": "5. Māghasuttaṃ ",
  "snp3.5:1.1": "Evaṃ me sutaṃ – ",
  "snp3.5:1.2": "eka samayaṃ bhagavā rājagahe viharati gijjhakūṭe pabbate. ",
  "snp3.5:1.3": "Atha kho māgho māṇavo yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṃ sammodi. ",
  "snp3.5:1.4": "Sammodanīyaṃ kathaṃ sāraṇīyaṃ vītisāretvā ekamantaṃ nisīdi. ",
  "snp3.5:1.5": "Ekamantaṃ nisinno kho māgho māṇavo bhagavantaṃ etadavoca – ",
  "snp3.5:2.1": "‘‘Ahañhi, bho gotama, dāyako dānapati vadaññū yācayogo; ",
  "snp3.5:2.2": "dhammena bhoge pariyesāmi; ",
  "snp3.5:2.3": "dhammena bhoge pariyesitvā dhammaladdhehi bhogehi dhammādhigatehi ekassapi dadāmi dvinnampi tiṇṇampi catunnampi pañcannampi channampi sattannampi aṭṭhannampi navannampi dasannampi dadāmi, vīsāyapi tiṃsāyapi cattālīsāyapi paññāsāyapi dadāmi, satassapi dadāmi, bhiyyopi dadāmi. ",
  "snp3.5:2.4": "Kaccāhaṃ, bho gotama, evaṃ dadanto evaṃ yajanto bahuṃ puññaṃ pasavāmī’’ti? ",
  "snp3.5:3.1": "‘‘Taggha tvaṃ, māṇava, evaṃ dadanto evaṃ yajanto bahuṃ puññaṃ pasavasi. ",
  "snp3.5:3.2": "Yo kho, māṇava, dāyako dānapati vadaññū yācayogo; ",
  "snp3.5:3.3": "dhammena bhoge pariyesati; ",
  "snp3.5:3.4": "dhammena bhoge pariyesitvā dhammaladdhehi bhogehi dhammādhigatehi ekassapi dadāti…pe… satassapi dadāti, bhiyyopi dadāti, bahuṃ so puññaṃ pasavatī’’ti. ",
  "snp3.5:3.5": "Atha kho māgho māṇavo bhagavantaṃ gāthāya ajjhabhāsi – ",
  "snp3.5:4.1": "491. ‘‘Pucchāmahaṃ gotamaṃ vadaññuṃ, ",
  "snp3.5:4.2": "(iti māgho māṇavo) ",
  "snp3.5:4.3": "Kāsāyavāsiṃ agahaṃ carantaṃ; ",
  "snp3.5:4.4": "Yo yācayogo dānapati gahaṭṭho, ",
  "snp3.5:4.5": "puññatthiko yajati puññapekkho; ",
  "snp3.5:4.6": "Dadaṃ paresaṃ idha annapānaṃ, ",
  "snp3.5:4.7": "kathaṃ hutaṃ yajamānassa sujjhe’’. ",
  "snp3.5:5.1": "492. ‘‘Yo yācayogo dānapati gahaṭṭho, ",
  "snp3.5:5.2": "(māghāti bhagavā) ",
  "snp3.5:5.3": "Puññatthiko yajati puññapekkho; ",
  "snp3.5:5.4": "Dadaṃ paresaṃ idha annapānaṃ, ",
  "snp3.5:5.5": "ārādhaye dakkhiṇeyyebhi tādi’’. ",
  "snp3.5:6.1": "493. ‘‘Yo yācayogo dānapati gahaṭṭho, ",
  "snp3.5:6.2": "(iti māgho māṇavo) ",
  "snp3.5:6.3": "Puññatthiko yajati puññapekkho; ",
  "snp3.5:6.4": "Dadaṃ paresaṃ idha annapānaṃ, ",
  "snp3.5:6.5": "akkhāhi me bhagavā dakkhiṇeyye’’. ",
  "snp3.5:7.1": "494. ‘‘Ye ve asattā vicaranti loke, ",
  "snp3.5:7.2": "akiñcanā kevalino yatattā; ",
  "snp3.5:7.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:7.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:8.1": "495. ‘‘Ye sabbasaṃyojanabandhanacchidā, ",
  "snp3.5:8.2": "dantā vimuttā anīghā nirāsā; ",
  "snp3.5:8.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:8.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:9.1": "496. ‘‘Ye sabbasaṃyojanavippamuttā, ",
  "snp3.5:9.2": "dantā vimuttā anīghā nirāsā; ",
  "snp3.5:9.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:9.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:10.1": "497. ‘‘Rāgañca dosañca pahāya mohaṃ, ",
  "snp3.5:10.2": "khīṇāsavā vūsitabrahmacariyā; ",
  "snp3.5:10.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:10.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:11.1": "498. ‘‘Yesu na māyā vasati na māno, ",
  "snp3.5:11.2": "khīṇāsavā vūsitabrahmacariyā; ",
  "snp3.5:11.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:11.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:12.1": "499. ‘‘Ye vītalobhā amamā nirāsā, ",
  "snp3.5:12.2": "khīṇāsavā vūsitabrahmacariyā; ",
  "snp3.5:12.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:12.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:13.1": "500. ‘‘Ye ve na taṇhāsu upātipannā, ",
  "snp3.5:13.2": "vitareyya oghaṃ amamā caranti; ",
  "snp3.5:13.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:13.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:14.1": "501. ‘‘Yesaṃ taṇhā natthi kuhiñci loke, ",
  "snp3.5:14.2": "bhavābhavāya idha vā huraṃ vā; ",
  "snp3.5:14.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:14.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:15.1": "502. ‘‘Ye kāme hitvā agahā caranti, ",
  "snp3.5:15.2": "susaññatattā tasaraṃva ujjuṃ; ",
  "snp3.5:15.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:15.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:16.1": "503. ‘‘Ye vītarāgā susamāhitindriyā, ",
  "snp3.5:16.2": "candova rāhuggahaṇā pamuttā; ",
  "snp3.5:16.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:16.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:17.1": "504. ‘‘Samitāvino vītarāgā akopā, ",
  "snp3.5:17.2": "yesaṃ gatī natthidha vippahāya; ",
  "snp3.5:17.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:17.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:18.1": "505. ‘‘Jahitvā jātimaraṇaṃ asesaṃ, ",
  "snp3.5:18.2": "kathaṃkathiṃ sabbamupātivattā; ",
  "snp3.5:18.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:18.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:19.1": "506. ‘‘Ye attadīpā vicaranti loke, ",
  "snp3.5:19.2": "akiñcanā sabbadhi vippamuttā; ",
  "snp3.5:19.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:19.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:20.1": "507. ‘‘Ye hettha jānanti yathā tathā idaṃ, ",
  "snp3.5:20.2": "ayamantimā natthi punabbhavoti; ",
  "snp3.5:20.3": "Kālena tesu habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:20.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha. ",
  "snp3.5:21.1": "508. ‘‘Yo vedagū jhānarato satīmā, ",
  "snp3.5:21.2": "sambodhipatto saraṇaṃ bahūnaṃ; ",
  "snp3.5:21.3": "Kālena tamhi habyaṃ pavecche, ",
  "snp3.5:21.4": "yo brāhmaṇo puññapekkho yajetha’’. ",
  "snp3.5:22.1": "509. ‘‘Addhā amoghā mama pucchanā ahu, ",
  "snp3.5:22.2": "",
  "snp3.5:22.3": "akkhāsi me bhagavā dakkhiṇeyye; ",
  "snp3.5:22.4": "Tvañhettha jānāsi yathā tathā idaṃ, ",
  "snp3.5:22.5": "tathā hi te vidito esa dhammo. ",
  "snp3.5:23.1": "510. ‘‘Yo yācayogo dānapati gahaṭṭho, (iti māgho māṇavo) ",
  "snp3.5:23.2": "Puññatthiko yajati puññapekkho; ",
  "snp3.5:23.3": "Dadaṃ paresaṃ idha annapānaṃ, ",
  "snp3.5:23.4": "Akkhāhi me bhagavā yaññasampadaṃ’’. ",
  "snp3.5:24.1": "511. ‘‘Yajassu yajamāno ",
  "snp3.5:24.2": "māghāti bhagavā, ",
  "snp3.5:24.3": "sabbattha ca vippasādehi cittaṃ; ",
  "snp3.5:24.4": "Ārammaṇaṃ yajamānassa yañño, ",
  "snp3.5:24.5": "etthappatiṭṭhāya jahāti dosaṃ. ",
  "snp3.5:25.1": "512. ‘‘So vītarāgo pavineyya dosaṃ, ",
  "snp3.5:25.2": "mettaṃ cittaṃ bhāvayamappamāṇaṃ; ",
  "snp3.5:25.3": "Rattindivaṃ satatamappamatto, ",
  "snp3.5:25.4": "sabbā disā pharati appamaññaṃ’’. ",
  "snp3.5:26.1": "513. ‘‘Ko sujjhati muccati bajjhatī ca, ",
  "snp3.5:26.2": "kenattanā gacchati brahmalokaṃ; ",
  "snp3.5:26.3": "Ajānato me muni brūhi puṭṭho, ",
  "snp3.5:26.4": "bhagavā hi me sakkhi brahmajjadiṭṭho; ",
  "snp3.5:26.5": "Tuvañhi no brahmasamosi saccaṃ, ",
  "snp3.5:26.6": "kathaṃ upapajjati brahmalokaṃ jutima’’. ",
  "snp3.5:27.1": "514. ‘‘Yo yajati tividhaṃ yaññasampadaṃ, ",
  "snp3.5:27.2": "(māghāti bhagavā) ",
  "snp3.5:27.3": "Ārādhaye dakkhiṇeyyebhi tādi; ",
  "snp3.5:27.4": "Evaṃ yajitvā sammā yācayogo, ",
  "snp3.5:27.5": "Upapajjati brahmalokanti brūmī’’ti. ",
  "snp3.5:28.1": "Evaṃ vutte, māgho māṇavo bhagavantaṃ etadavoca – ",
  "snp3.5:28.2": "‘‘abhikkantaṃ, bho gotama…pe… ",
  "snp3.5:28.3": "ajjatagge pāṇupetaṃ saraṇaṃ gata’’nti. ",
  "snp3.5:28.4": "Māghasuttaṃ pañcamaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ. "
}
